d 'SSC2': module providing access to the Next Generation SSC Archive
d
d  Thie routine provides access to the Next Generation SSC Archive.
d  It is a drop-in replacement for the system-provided ssc command,
d allowing installation of date-specific snapshots of packages from
d a mirror of the SSC archive. It adds a date() option that selects
d a snapshot of SSC as of that date, and a from() option to point
d at an alternative mirror. Where nothing snapshot-specific is
d requested, ssc2 executes the official ssc command. 
d
d KW: community-contributed software
d KW: snapshot
d KW: SSC archive
d KW: reproducibility
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260929
d
d Author: Lars Vilhuber,  Cornell University
d Support: email lars.vilhuber@@cornell.edu
d
f ssc2.ado
f ssc2.sthlp
